# Provider credentials for musicvideo-manager.
#
# This file documents the format only -- the real file does NOT live
# here or anywhere inside a library's .musicvideo-manager/ directory.
# Copy it to:
#
#   ~/.config/musicvideo-manager/.env
#
# A library's per-library state travels with the library (backups,
# copies, sharing); a provider credential should not travel with it.
# See docs/adr/0008-fanarttv-artist-artwork.md.

FANARTTV_API_KEY=
